g==\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I can help, but I need the patient context first—“treatment options” in nephrology depend completely on the condition and severity.\n\nPlease send the key details for this patient, such as:\n- **Main kidney problem/diagnosis**: e.g. CKD, nephrotic syndrome, AKI, kidney stone, glomerulonephritis, polycystic kidney disease\n- **Recent labs**: creatinine, eGFR, potassium, bicarbonate, urine protein/albumin\n- **Symptoms**: swelling, reduced urine, blood in urine, pain, shortness of breath, high blood pressure\n- **Relevant history**: diabetes, hypertension, autoimmune disease, infection, medications, dialysis, transplant status\n\nIf you want, I can also help structure the case in a nephrology-style summary and then outline the likely treatment options.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0e031b6beebdf1950169c291f4e1888191b169e2377675756b\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":2489,"output":315,"cacheRead":8832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":11636,"cost":{"input":0.006222500000000001,"output":0.004725,"cacheRead":0.002208,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0131555}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774359025084}}
